[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2498320318","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99676#issuecomment-2498320318","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99676","id":2498320318,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6U6Ve-","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-25T15:24:10Z","updated_at":"2024-11-25T15:24:10Z","body":"cicd wants documentation.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2498320318/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2514873765","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99676#issuecomment-2514873765","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99676","id":2514873765,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6V5e2l","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-03T15:24:41Z","updated_at":"2024-12-03T15:25:32Z","body":"> The other processes (such as format optimization) happen after this one, which makes it possible to remove unneeded color channels (like alpha), and the following steps (like compression) will take that into account (for instance by compressing as DXT1 instead of DXT5).\r\n\r\nThat reminds me, could we apply the **Optimized** Channel Pack mode when a texture is detected as being imported as an ORM texture? If its blue channel is `0` on all pixels, we can then compress it as RGTC to save some VRAM or improve quality for its AO and roughness channels. It's quite common for ORM materials to not be metallic at all, which is why their separate texture versions don't feature a metallic map.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2514873765/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613244546","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99676#issuecomment-2613244546","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99676","id":2613244546,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bwvKC","user":{"login":"RedMser","id":5117197,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTcxOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5117197?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser","html_url":"https://github.com/RedMser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-24T19:33:13Z","updated_at":"2025-01-25T08:41:59Z","body":"By the way, you might want to remove the \"clean up\" commit from this PR. It is already merged, so now you're just committing whitespace changes with it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613244546/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613267960","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99676#issuecomment-2613267960","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99676","id":2613267960,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bw034","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-24T19:48:45Z","updated_at":"2025-01-24T19:48:45Z","body":"As part of the import team, I like this! Let's try to get it reviewed and approved for 4.5.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613267960/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2733332457","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99676#issuecomment-2733332457","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99676","id":2733332457,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6i61fp","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-18T13:51:41Z","updated_at":"2025-03-18T13:51:41Z","body":"There are some details to this implementation that I'm not certain about:\r\n\r\n1. When a source image has less channels than specified in the remap settings, they get ignored. Should the channel count automatically increase?\r\n2. When the image has HDR data, should the settings be ignored? Currently, any source value greater than one will become negative.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2733332457/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2734119710","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99676#issuecomment-2734119710","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99676","id":2734119710,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6i91se","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-18T17:24:26Z","updated_at":"2025-03-18T17:25:31Z","body":"> 2. When the image has HDR data, should the settings be ignored? Currently, any source value greater than one will become negative.\r\n\r\nIt still makes sense to support channel remap for HDR data, but perhaps the Inverted modes should act like the regular ones in this case (with a warning printed on import).\r\n\r\nIf we really wanted them to work like SDR data, then we could loop over all the image's pixels, figure out the brightest pixel for each channel, then invert the value based on that. It may not be worth the effort to implement this though, given how rarely I expect inverted mapping to be used for HDR images.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2734119710/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2877996779","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99676#issuecomment-2877996779","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99676","id":2877996779,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rir7r","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-13T21:28:39Z","updated_at":"2025-05-13T21:28:39Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2877996779/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2881616941","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99676#issuecomment-2881616941","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99676","id":2881616941,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rwfwt","user":{"login":"LiveTrower","id":48926464,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4OTI2NDY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48926464?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower","html_url":"https://github.com/LiveTrower","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T21:24:30Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T21:24:30Z","body":"> 1. When a source image has less channels than specified in the remap settings, they get ignored. Should the channel count automatically increase?\r\n\r\nBefore testing this new feature, I thought it would work this way, but I was surprised to find that it doesn't. In my opinion, I believe this should be done to make it more useful, and also because more than one person will expect this behavior, especially if they come from Unity, since Unity does allow you to move a channel to another even if it doesn't exist in the texture.\r\n\r\n![Unity](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0d3124b5-f7ef-4c7d-b6fb-02b4be273203)\r\nAs you can see, Unity allowed me to move the red channel to the alpha channel.\r\n\r\n![Godot](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/25c06933-4958-48c2-9595-7c4840b1f139)\r\nIn the case of Godot, I'm not sure if it's a bug, but for some reason, it does create the alpha channel but leaves it blank.\r\n\r\nHere the [textures](https://ambientcg.com/view?id=Planks036B).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2881616941/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2881635408","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99676#issuecomment-2881635408","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99676","id":2881635408,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rwkRQ","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx",